text.section:
An electronic registration application completed pursuant to this article shall require that an applicant:

Provide the information as required under § 24.2-418;


Have a Virginia driver's license or other document issued by the Department of Motor Vehicles under Chapter 3 (§ 46.2-300 et seq.) of Title 46.2;


Provide a social security number and Department of Motor Vehicles customer identifier number that matches the applicant's record in the Department of Motor Vehicles records;


Attest to the truth of the information provided;


Sign the application in a manner consistent with the Uniform Electronic Transactions Act (§ 59.1-479 et seq.); and


Affirmatively authorize the Department of Elections and general registrar to use the applicant's signature obtained by the Department of Motor Vehicles for voter registration purposes.
